WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.080 --> 00:00:02.770
A new smoothie bar opens its doors.

2
00:00:02.770 --> 00:00:04.970
Before a single customer walks in,

3
00:00:04.970 --> 00:00:08.580
it already owes 2,000 pounds this month.

4
00:00:08.580 --> 00:00:11.010
Each smoothie sells for 4 pounds.

5
00:00:11.010 --> 00:00:14.920
But the fruit, the cup and
the card fee cost money too.

6
00:00:14.920 --> 00:00:17.730
So the first sale does not end the losses.

7
00:00:17.730 --> 00:00:19.320
Neither does the tenth.

8
00:00:19.320 --> 00:00:21.910
So how many customers
does a new business need

9
00:00:21.910 --> 00:00:24.200
before it stops losing money?

10
00:00:24.200 --> 00:00:27.550
In this mission, you'll split
each sale into two parts,

11
00:00:27.550 --> 00:00:29.740
and see which part pays the rent.

12
00:00:29.740 --> 00:00:33.020
Then you'll draw the chart
where losses turn into profit,

13
00:00:33.020 --> 00:00:35.040
and move the rent and the price to see

14
00:00:35.040 --> 00:00:37.060
the turning point slide.

15
00:00:37.060 --> 00:00:41.170
Your mission: find out the number
of sales that ends the losses.
